// Ch14 B01: one of the six Lamplighters who carry the flames in.
title: ch14_bark_lamplighter
location: ch14/lacquer_court
---
Townsfolk as "Lamp-bearer" [neutral]: Six of us carry the lamps in. The whole length of the court, and the flame mustn't lean. I've practised all week. #line:ch14_bark_lamp_001
===
